    { "dot": "amber", "title": "The envelope (D32)", "items": ["A JSON object in the payload carries key, stamp and exit; anything else is a reading of its text", "A reading with no at is stamped with the receive time and says stamped_by: receiver", "MQTT v5 properties were rejected: only a 3.1.1 broker can be proven here"] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Three slots, one lock", "items": ["A sensor filter keeps only the latest message; staleness is data via age_seconds", "A witness filter queues every message; one is handed over per invoke", "An ack is matched to the act in flight by (ack_topic, key) — an ack for another key is not ours"] },
